OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster sentenced over #2m
OL,4,Ajewellery scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been sentenced to 12 years in
OL,7,Fprison for defrauding people in a
OL,8,Fjewellery scam valued at more than #2m,
OL,9,Fa court has heard.
OL,11,FThrough two companies, James Charles,
OL,12,Ffrom Roman Crescent in Southwick, West
OL,13,FSussex, took jewellery and promised to
OL,14,Frepair or resell it, only for victims
OL,15,Fto receive nothing or a fraction of
OL,16,Fwhat was promised, Sussex Police said.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
