OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFraudster sentenced over #2m
OL,4,Ajewellery scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 49-year-old, also known as Jamie
OL,7,FGoatley, had changed his plea to guilty
OL,8,Ffor four counts of carrying on business
OL,9,Fof a company with intent to defraud
OL,10,Fcreditors, or for other fraudulent
OL,11,Fpurposes.
OL,13,FAt the sentencing at Southwark Crown
OL,14,FCourt on Thursday, Judge Martin
OL,15,FGriffith said Charles was a "practised
OL,16,Fand inveterate fraudster".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
